This PR fixes handling of multiple CSS rules inside `element.children` for `getElementReference()`. This happens for cases when Griffel emits rules that flip in RTL.

```css
@media screen and (max-width: 992px) {
  .f1f6067w {
    text-align: left;
  }
  .f133ge8t {
    text-align: right;
  }
}
```

